0067:                   * This sets D to 0 if bit 5 of R$A is NOT set.  If bit 5 of R$A is set
0067:                   * when called, register Y will contain a default file size
0067: A601                       lda   R$A,x            get file mode (read/write/update)
0069: 5F                         clrb  
