0DD7:                   * 0,S  = number of clusters to allocate
0DD7:                   * 2,S  = DD.BIT  number of sectors per cluster
0DD7:                   * 4,S  = DD.MAP  number of bytes in the allocation bitmap
0DD7:                   * 6,S  = V.MapSCT lowest reasonable bitmap sector number (current bitmap sect)
0DD7:                   * 7,S  = sector number of the largest contiguous free bits found
0DD7:                   * 8,S  = number of contiguous free bits found
0DD7:                   * 10,s = bit offset into the sector of the found contiguous bits
0DD7:                   * 10,s = also  DD.BIT  number of sectors per cluster
0DD7:                   * 12,S = number of sectors to search for  (D from the calling routine)
0DD7:                   * 16,S = PD pointer (Y from the calling routine)
